    <string name="about">About</string>
    <string name="version_format">Version %1$s</string>
    <string name="developer_format">Developed by %1$s</string>
    <string name="about_body">MissionPlayer is a modern local music player for people who listen to their own library. Playback is fully offline, with no ads, accounts or trackers.\n\nLIBRARY\n• Songs, Albums, Artists and Folders tabs, in an order you choose\n• Shortcuts to Favorites, Playlists and Recent; your own playlists\n• 7 sort orders (A to Z, Z to A, newest, most played, artist, album, duration), also inside albums, folders and lists\n• Alphabet bar to jump straight to a letter\n• Hide songs and folders (subfolders stay visible)\n• Folder photo: from the gallery or from the covers of the songs in the folder\n• Select several songs in a folder and send them to a playlist\n• Add songs from inside a playlist, with search and multi-select\n• Playlist photo (gallery or song covers) that becomes the small cover in the list\n\nSEARCH\n• By title, artist, album and also inside song lyrics\n\nPLAYER\n• Mini player and Now Playing screen with a liquid glass effect that blends the cover colors\n• Mini player cover spins slowly like a vinyl record while the music plays\n• Player themes (player only): Liquid glass, AMOLED black, Blurred cover, Aurora, Solid color and Graphite\n• The player opens from the bottom; swipe the cover to change song\n• Synced lyrics (.lrc), text (.txt) and lyrics embedded in files\n• Automatic lyrics: finds missing ones by itself and keeps them for offline use\n• Custom covers: import from the gallery, search online by name or remove\n• Queue, repeat (off, all, one) and shuffle\n• Shuffle that never repeats and never ends\n• Resume where you stopped: queue, song, position and modes saved\n\nSOUND\n• Equalizer with presets, bass boost and surround\n• Volume boost up to about +15 dB\n• Set as ringtone and share\n\nUPDATES\n• Check for updates inside About: compares your version with the latest GitHub release and opens the APK download\n\nLOOK\n• Light, dark or system mode\n• Customization: app icon and name, free accent color, background color or image and 19 fonts\n• Full screen, including under the camera notch\n• Portuguese (Brazil) and English\n\nSTATISTICS\n• Most played songs, artists and albums and the time you really listened, with a reset button\n\nPRIVACY\n• No ads or trackers. The internet is used only to download lyrics, search covers and check for updates, when you use those features</string>
